## Key Concepts
- OAuth2/OIDC, Managed Identities, Conditional Access, PIM
- Private Endpoints, VNet integration, RBAC scoping
- Defender for Cloud, UEBA, alerting
- Secrets rotation and rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal token validation sketch for a Node.js API
const express = require('express');
const jwt = require('jsonwebtoken');
function authorize(requiredScope) {
  return (req, res, next) => {
    const token = req.headers.authorization?.split(' ')[1];
    if (!token) return res.sendStatus(401);
    const decoded = jwt.decode(token, { complete: true });
    if (!decoded || !decoded.payload.scp?.includes(requiredScope)) return res.sendStatus(403);
    next();
  };
}
```

